#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:1
msgid "SecInterp User Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:3
msgid "1. Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:5
msgid ""
"Welcome to the SecInterp plugin! This guide will help you get started "
"with creating geological cross-sections from your QGIS layers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:7
msgid "SecInterp allows you to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:8
msgid "Create a topographic profile from a Digital Elevation Model (DEM)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:9
msgid "Project geological units from a polygon layer onto the profile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:10
msgid "Project structural measurements (e.g., dip and strike) onto the profile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:11
msgid ""
"Project drillhole traces and geological intervals (sondajes) onto the "
"section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:12
msgid ""
"**Interpretation Tool**: Digitize geological interpretations directly on "
"the section with smart snapping."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:13
msgid ""
"**3D Export (PolygonZ)**: Export your 2D interpretations as valid 3D "
"Shapefiles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:14
msgid ""
"**i18n Support**: Core interface available in 10 languages (English, "
"Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Chinese, Hindi, "
"Japanese)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:15
msgid "View an interactive preview with level-of-detail (LOD) optimization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:16
msgid "Measure distances and gradients with automatic snapping to vertices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:18
msgid "2. The Main Window"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:20
msgid "The SecInterp dialog is divided into three main areas:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:21
msgid ""
"**Sidebar Navigation (Left)**: Navigate between different modules: DEM, "
"Drillholes, Geology, Structure, Settings, and Help."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:22
msgid ""
"**Configuration Page (Center)**: Where you configure the parameters for "
"the selected module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:23
msgid ""
"**Preview Panel (Right)**: An interactive canvas showing your cross-"
"section in real-time."
msgstr ""

