#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:133
msgid "Topography surface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:134
msgid "Drillhole contacts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:135
msgid "Existing interpretation vertices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:136
msgid "**Undo**: Right-click to remove the last vertex."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:137
msgid "**Finalize**: Double-click (or press Enter) to close the polygon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/USER_GUIDE.md:138
msgid ""
"**Properties**: A dialog will appear to set the **Lithology**, "
"**Formation**, and **Color** of the new polygon."
